  m_Name: Object_65
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Oil Sump Gasket
  description: The Oil Sump Gasket is a small, thin-flat gasket located at the bottom-center-center
    of the engine, sealing the oil sump to prevent oil leaks and maintain engine
    lubrication. Its thin shape and small size enable it to fit precisely between
    the oil sump and the engine block, ensuring a secure seal. Interestingly, the
    gasket's material composition, Material.001, provides excellent resistance to
    oil and fuel, making it an ideal choice for this application.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
